# NON-OPTIONAL, and the failure without it is confusing.
#
# Helm packs the entire chart directory into the release Secret, which etcd caps
# at 1 MB. projects/ is four git checkouts and site/ carries a Breakout jar's
# worth of build input — none of which renders a template. Leave them in and
# `helm upgrade` fails with:
#
#     Secret "sh.helm.release.v1.fsu.v1" is invalid: data: Too long
#
# Same reasoning as web/old-diemer-codes and web/luke-birthday. Check with
# `helm package . -d /tmp && ls -lh /tmp/fsu-*.tgz` — single-digit KB is right.

projects/
site/
nginx/
terminal/
pybank/
Dockerfile.web
Dockerfile.terminal
Dockerfile.pybank
.dockerignore
build.sh
upgrade.sh
README.md

.git/
.gitignore
*.tgz
values.local.yaml
values.local.tpl.yaml
